# Building the APK

Always build the release APK with:

```powershell
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/build_apk.ps1
```

It runs `flutter build apk --release --dart-define-from-file=.env` and copies the result to `dist/Aurora-Music-v<version>-build<n>.apk` (version from `pubspec.yaml`). Tell the user the path in `dist/`, not `build/app/outputs/...`.

`dist/` is git-ignored; never commit APKs.
